// Test: Keywords and identifiers.

// All reserved keywords
and class else false for fun if nil or print return super this true var while

// Basic valid identifiers
hello
_hello
hello123
my_variable
_123

// Identifiers that resemble keywords but are not keywords
variable orchid while_loop andrew classroom elsewhere falsehood
forest function iffy nil_value original printer return_value superman
this_value true_value var_name